{"id":81158,"title":"Exact shadow trace: skip empty 32³ super-bricks + occupied-box early-out","url":"https://github.com/0x63616c/voxelite/pull/41","final_url":"https://github.com/0x63616c/voxelite/pull/41","year":2026,"kind":"qa","source":"github-issues","doi":null,"arxiv":null,"sha256":"c9fd7e18ec01b3ac5a543c9d67cd554e1ab80e87b9d9d4f0906be4a65c9db8de","ctype":"text/html; charset=utf-8","text_src":"url","fetched_at":1793144016.709655,"text_chars":14371,"abstract":"Step 1 of the perf plan: a faster **exact** shadow trace. Stacked on #38 (base `perf/render-harness`; retarget to `main` once #38 merges). No quality change: output must stay pixel-identical per `cargo xtask visual`.\n\n## Design\n- Second occupancy level: super-bricks of 4^3 bricks (32^3 cells) with a nonempty bitset appended after the brick mask. Grow-only occupied AABB in the header.\n- `trace_shadow` DDA: if the super-brick is empty, jump with `skip_box(32)`; else if the brick is empty, `skip_box(8)`; else the fine per-voxel DDA. `skip_box` uses the same crossing/tie logic as the fine DDA, so the visited-cell decision is identical.\n- Early-out: the ray is monotonic per axis, so once a cell is past the occupied box on an axis it is moving toward (`step>=0 && cell>amax` or `step<=0 && cell<amin`) it can never hit; an empty grid returns false immediately. Exact, not approximate.\n- Iteration cap (768) unchanged; skipping only reduces iterations per ray.\n- ABI: `HEADER_WORDS` 12 -> 20 (box min/max words 12-14 / 16-18, super-mask offset in word 7); buffer layout header, bricks, brick mask, super mask. Shader uniform layout test updated.\n- `trace(..., skip=false)` stays the pure fine reference for tests.\n\n## Evidence so far\n- fmt, clippy `-D warnings` (Linux, plus aarch64-apple-darwin render crate), `cargo test --workspace --locked`: pass.\n- Proptests compare the CPU mirror and WGSL transliteration (with skipping + early-out) against the fine DDA, including sparse 256^3 / 160^3 grids and tie cases; incremental updates vs rebuilt occupancy (box containment, super masks).\n- Lavapipe `cargo xtask visual` vs the harness goldens (autumn, sponge1m, terrain1m stills): bit-exact, max delta 0, 0.000000% pixels differing.\n\n## M2 Metal results\n- **Visual (PR run 40467823359, `visual --determinism`, M2 vs committed goldens):** all 9 stills `pass; exact=true, max delta 0, differing 0.000000%`, determinism OK.\n- **Bench v1** (commit a62e7ea, dispatch 40462130376 vs harness 3a2d412 dispatch 40462128083, both 5 runs x 90 frames, same mini, similar load; `bench/baseline` unchanged). Shadow trace was faster on autumn/terrain (GPU p50 -14..-34%, terrain1m orbit_close 73.1 -> 48.3 ms) but **regressed sponge1m by ~+8..14%** (dense, no empty space to skip: extra super-mask read + early-out math each iteration). Table:\n\n| scene/phase | wall p50 before | after | Δ% | wall p95 before | after | GPU total p50 before | after | Δ% | GPU shadow p50 before | after | occupancy bytes Δ |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|--:|\n| autumn/cold | 96.43 | 95.59 | -0.9 | 96.43 | 95.59 | 18.31 | 21.42 | +17.0 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/edit_1voxel | 20.94 | 16.98 | -18.9 | 21.49 | 17.27 | 18.10 | 14.22 | -21.4 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/edit_cube16 | 27.13 | 23.26 | -14.3 | 28.11 | 24.12 | 18.08 | 14.22 | -21.4 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/edit_cube40 | 35.58 | 31.41 | -11.7 | 36.55 | 32.29 | 18.66 | 14.72 | -21.1 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/edit_recolor | 64.21 | 61.84 | -3.7 | 68.65 | 65.82 | 18.63 | 16.34 | -12.3 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/edit_slab64 | 32.43 | 28.32 | -12.7 | 33.36 | 29.27 | 18.18 | 14.29 | -21.4 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/fit | 18.56 | 14.78 | -20.4 | 18.71 | 14.87 | 18.10 | 14.32 | -20.9 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/orbit_close | 39.18 | 32.44 | -17.2 | 63.37 | 43.42 | 38.62 | 31.98 | -17.2 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| autumn/orbit_fit | 18.63 | 16.09 | -13.7 | 23.57 | 19.55 | 18.17 | 15.60 | -14.2 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 36 |\n| sponge1m/cold | 821